# 🎉 Python Fun Fact

Nested loops are commonly used in game development to work with rows and columns of a game board.

---

# 🔄 Quick Recap

- Nested loops can create many different patterns.
- The outer loop controls rows.
- The inner loop controls what appears in each row.

